#!ipxe
# UniBoot Entry Script
# Copyright (c) 2026-present SnowdreamTech Inc.
# Trigger build: FULL HTTPS + Commands for BIOS and EFI

dhcp ||
# 1. Local-first: Fetch local uniboot.ipxe from USB
# 2. Cloud fallback: Fetch latest uniboot.ipxe from GitHub
# 3. Fallback to official Netboot.xyz main menu
# 4. Fallback to interactive iPXE shell
chain file:/ipxe/uniboot.ipxe || chain https://raw.githubusercontent.com/snowdreamtech/UniBoot/main/ipxe/uniboot.ipxe || chain https://boot.netboot.xyz/menu.ipxe || shell

